Bahut se log is cheez ka anubhav kar chuke hain.
Par koi iske baare mein baat nahi karta.
Ye na neend mein hota hai.
Na sapne mein.
Ye tab hota hai
jab insaan poori tarah jaag raha hota hai.
Pehli baar jab ye mehsoos hota hai,
to koi darr nahi lagta.
Bas ek ajeeb si baat samajh aati hai.
Jaise tum apne khud ke khayalon ko
sirf soch nahi rahe…
balki unhe koi aur bhi dekh raha ho.
Tum kuch sochne jaate ho,
aur khayal poora hone se pehle hi
ruk jaata hai.
Jaise kisi ne pehle hi
usse padh liya ho.
Us pal sab kuch normal hota hai.
Dil dhadak raha hota hai.
Saans chal rahi hoti hai.
Par dimaag ke andar
ek baat bilkul saaf hoti hai—
“Mujhe dekh liya gaya hai.”
Us din ke baad
ye cheez dobara mehsoos nahi hoti.
Par jab bhi tum us pal ko
yaad karne ki koshish karte ho,
yaad aadhi raah mein hi
band ho jaati hai.
Na isliye ki tum bhool gaye.
Balki isliye
kyunki yaad aane ki
ijazat nahi hoti.
Baad mein aur log bhi
yahi baat kehne lage.
Alag shehar.
Alag log.
Par ek hi vaakya—
“Use pata chal jaata hai
jab tum use mehsoos kar lete ho.”
Jo log is cheez ko
dobara mehsoos karna chahte the,
unhone sirf ek baat batayi—
sochna zyada saaf lagne laga.
Aur ye ehsaas hone laga
ki zyada saaf sochna
surakshit nahi hai.
Agla hissa batata hai
kya hota hai
jab koi ise do baar mehsoos kar leta hai.
